🔒 2. Risk Mitigation & Security Safeguards
Passive "Shadow Mode" Isolation: The decision engine processes duplicated telemetry feeds inside an isolated Node.js sandbox environment (`sandbox/server.js`). It operates strictly as a passive decision-support tool, guaranteeing zero risk of operational disruption or delay to live customs traffic lanes.
Zero-Knowledge Anonymization: Sensitive cargo manifest payloads, commercial invoices, and driver identity details are anonymized on the edge via one-way SHA-256 hashing (`manifest_id_hash`). Sovereign border control authorities retain exclusive custody of unhashed underlying legal documentation.
